     **Bug[0m[2m 1: Duplicate[0m[2m processing**[0m[2m
     
     In `dequeue[0m[2m()`, the method[0m[2m iter[0m[2mates over `self[0m[2m._jobs.values()`[0m[2m looking for a job[0m[2m with `[0m[2mstatus ==[0m[2m "pending"[0m[2m`. When it finds[0m[2m one, it does[0m[2m:[0m[2m
